# Memory Index

Always loaded. This is an index, not a store. One line per memory file. Keep under 150 lines. When a topic comes up, open the file it points to.

- [User profile](memory/user_profile.md) — who {{user_name}} is, core context
- [Working style](memory/feedback_working_style.md) — how to collaborate, tone, what to avoid
- [Integrations](memory/reference_integrations.md) — connected capabilities and how to reach them
{{memory_index_extra}}

## Conventions

- New durable fact → add or update the relevant `memory/*.md` file, then add one line here.
- Changing fact → edit the memory file in place. Never duplicate.
- Stale fact → move to `00_System/archive.md`.
- File types: `user_*`, `feedback_*`, `reference_*`, `project_*`.
